{"ticker":"LEN","updated":"2026-10-30T22:56:29Z","profile":{"longName":"Lennar Corporation","shortName":"Lennar Corporation","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Residential Construction","country":"United States","website":"https://www.lennar.com","fullTimeEmployees":12532,"marketCap":20683046912,"trailingPE":16.465908,"forwardPE":16.650484,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":0.64688945,"pegRatio":11.3,"targetMeanPrice":77.73333,"targetHighPrice":120.0,"targetLowPrice":63.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":15,"recommendationKey":"underperform","revenueGrowth":-0.087,"earningsGrowth":-0.482,"grossMargins":0.16014999,"operatingMargins":0.056929998,"profitMargins":0.04092,"totalRevenue":31973076992,"beta":1.376,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":133.76,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":71.78,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.34},"summary":"Lennar Corporation, together with its subsidiaries, operates as a homebuilder primarily under the Lennar brand in the United States. It operates through Homebuilding East, Homebuilding Central, Homebuilding South Central, Homebuilding West, Financial Services, Multifamily, and Lennar Other segments. The company's homebuilding operations include the construction and sale of single-family attached and detached homes, as well as the purchase, development, and sale of residential land; and development, construction, and management of multifamily rental properties. It also offers residential mortgage financing, title insurance, and closing services for home buyers and others, as well as originating and selling securitization commercial mortgage loans. In addition, the company is involved in fund investment activities. It primarily serves first-time, move-up, active adult, and luxury homebuyers. The company was founded in 1954 and is based in Miami, Florida.","summary_zh":"Lennar Corporation 及其子公司在美國主要以 Lennar 品牌作為住宅建築商運作。該公司透過 Homebuilding East、Homebuilding Central、Homebuilding South Central、Homebuilding West、金融服務、多戶住宅和 Lennar 其他部門營運。該公司的住宅建築業務包括建造和銷售單戶附屬住宅和獨立式住宅，以及購買、開發和銷售住宅用地；以及多戶出租物業的開發、建設和管理。它還為購房者和其他人提供住宅抵押貸款融資、產權保險和過戶服務，以及發起和銷售證券化商業抵押貸款。此外，該公司也從事基金投資活動。它主要服務於首次購房者、升級購房者、活躍的成年人和豪華購房者。該公司成立於 1954 年，總部位於佛羅裡達州邁阿密。","sector_zh":"週期性消費","industry_zh":"住宅建設","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":130.5,"h":133.34,"l":130.32,"c":132.68,"v":2400400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":132.15,"h":134.96,"l":131.51,"c":134.08,"v":2574000},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":135.58,"h":138.63,"l":135.0,"c":138.07,"v":2970500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":141.69,"h":144.24,"l":140.5,"c":141.88,"v":4268800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":141.5,"h":142.61,"l":139.81,"c":142.4,"v":2831300},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":141.5,"h":141.84,"l":136.49,"c":137.45,"v":3702000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":138.75,"h":138.82,"l":135.57,"c":136.58,"v":2726600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":137.52,"h":140.71,"l":137.52,"c":140.09,"v":2468100},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":140.0,"h":140.0,"l":136.97,"c":137.27,"v":2854200},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":137.88,"h":137.88,"l":132.28,"c":133.77,"v":4581900},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":134.48,"h":134.71,"l":131.21,"c":133.81,"v":4007900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":134.63,"h":139.44,"l":131.79,"c":132.97,"v":5872100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":133.01,"h":134.07,"l":131.34,"c":132.87,"v":5239900},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":126.5,"h":131.47,"l":125.16,"c":127.32,"v":17041300},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":124.75,"h":125.05,"l":121.1,"c":121.91,"v":6043700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":122.46,"h":123.76,"l":121.85,"c":123.25,"v":4178900},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":123.2,"h":126.7,"l":122.45,"c":125.69,"v":3557700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":124.15,"h":126.93,"l":123.78,"c":124.02,"v":3406100},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":125.01,"h":126.88,"l":124.15,"c":126.04,"v":2430900},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":127.44,"h":128.26,"l":125.41,"c":127.68,"v":3359900},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":127.51,"h":127.88,"l":124.5,"c":126.04,"v":2435300},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":126.5,"h":128.55,"l":126.3,"c":128.21,"v":2462700},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":128.0,"h":128.64,"l":126.57,"c":128.33,"v":1718400},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":128.32,"h":130.83,"l":128.3,"c":1